# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Generate the noise-mitigating observable {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "2. Die rauschmindernde Observable erzeugen {#2-generate-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) propagates each Pauli generator of the inverse noise channel forward to the end of the circuit. The observable is then back-propagated through the inverse noise channel, returning a new observable $\\tilde{O}$. Three key parameters affect the computation cost:\n"
msgstr "[generate_noise_mitigating_observable](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-pna/qiskit-addon-pna#generate_noise_mitigating_observable) propagiert jeden Pauli-Generator des inversen Rauschkanals vorwärts bis zum Ende des Circuits. Die Observable wird anschließend rückwärts durch den inversen Rauschkanal propagiert, wodurch eine neue Observable $\\tilde{O}$ entsteht. Drei Schlüsselparameter beeinflussen die Rechenkosten:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_err_terms`: the number of terms kept in each anti-noise generator as it is propagated forward.\n"
msgstr "`max_err_terms`: die Anzahl der Terme, die in jedem Anti-Rausch-Generator beim Vorwärtspropagieren behalten werden.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`max_obs_terms`: the number of terms kept in $\\tilde{O}$.\n"
msgstr "`max_obs_terms`: die Anzahl der Terme, die in $\\tilde{O}$ behalten werden.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`atol`: terms with coefficient magnitude below this threshold are dropped.\n"
msgstr "`atol`: Terme mit einem Koeffizientenbetrag unterhalb dieses Schwellenwerts werden verworfen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this small, near-Clifford circuit we set the term limits high and use a modest `atol`, so $\\tilde{O}$ stays small and we can measure all of its terms.\n"
msgstr "Für diesen kleinen, nahezu Clifford-artigen Circuit setzen wir die Termgrenzen hoch an und verwenden ein moderates `atol`, sodass $\\tilde{O}$ klein bleibt und wir alle seine Terme messen können.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "***Note: This function uses Python `multiprocessing`. When running as a script, call it inside an `if __name__ == \"__main__\":` guard.***\n"
msgstr "***Hinweis: Diese Funktion verwendet Python-`multiprocessing`. Wenn sie als Skript ausgeführt wird, rufe sie innerhalb eines `if __name__ == \"__main__\":`-Guards auf.***\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Mitigate gate errors by measuring the noise-mitigating observable {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"
msgstr "3. Gate-Fehler mindern, indem die rauschmindernde Observable gemessen wird {#3-mitigate-gate-errors-by-measuring-the-noise-mitigating-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we see that the new observable effectively mitigates the gate noise affecting the experiment.\n"
msgstr "Hier sehen wir, dass die neue Observable das Gate-Rauschen, das das Experiment beeinträchtigt, wirksam mindert.\n"

